// Two sources:
//  - curatedPlaces: hand-written SAMPLE entries (approximate coordinates, surfaces to verify on site)
//  - osm-places.json: every playground / park / garden in Hà Nội from OpenStreetMap,
//    generated by scripts/fetch-osm.mjs + scripts/build-places.mjs (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL)
